      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is difficult to project a sense of cosmic purpose when your role is viewed as mundane by those around you, but authenticity in these situations often comes from embracing your current reality rather than hiding a future destiny. You can cultivate presence by focusing on genuine connection and quiet confidence in your current duties, rather than trying to perform a role that hasn't yet been recognized. Remember that true authority is usually felt by being present and authentic in the here and now, not by expecting others to read your mind about distant futures.",
